 Conditions","cookies":"Cookies","linkReviews":"Reviews","linkSitemap":"Sitemap"},"contact":{"metaTitle":"Contact WeEvolveIT — tell us where it hurts","metaDescription":"Start the diagnosis. Tell us what isn't working in your business and a senior consultant will get back to you — usually within one business day. HQ Monterrey, with presence in Houston and Dubai.","eyebrow":"Contact","h1":"Let's build what's next.","lead":"No forms-to-nowhere. Answer four quick questions and a senior consultant reviews it personally — usually back to you within one business day.","whereWeAre":"Where we are","writeUs":"Write to us","followUs":"Follow us","talkNow":"Prefer to reach us directly?","emailGeneralLabel":"General","emailSalesLabel":"Sales","presenceMonterrey":"HQ · México","presenceHouston":"USA","presenceDubai":"UAE","monterreyAddress":"Venustiano Carranza 601, 64710 Monterrey, N.L.","received":"✓ Received","thanks":"Thanks, {name} — we're on it.","thanksFallback":"there","sentLead":"A senior consultant will review what you told us and get back to you at ","sentWhatsapp":" (or WhatsApp)","sentTail":" — usually within one business day.","labelName":"Name","labelCompany":"Company","labelPain":"What hurts","promptName":"Let's start simple — what should we call you?","promptOrg":"Nice to meet you, {name}. Where do you work?","promptPain":"So — what hurts? Tell us what isn't working.","promptContact":"Got it. Where do we send the diagnosis?","phName":"your name *","phCompany":"company (optional)","phWebsite":"website (optional)","phPain":"The process that drags, the data nobody trusts, the system fighting your team… *","phEmail":"you@company.com *","phWhatsapp":"WhatsApp (optional, faster)","optional":"Optional","ariaName":"Name","ariaCompany":"Company name","ariaWebsite":"Website","ariaPain":"What hurts","ariaEmail":"Email","ariaWhatsapp":"WhatsApp number","phLastName":"last name *","ariaLastName":"Last name","phPhone":"WhatsApp or phone (optional)","ariaPhone":"WhatsApp or phone","errGeneric":"Something went wrong — try again.","errNetwork":"Network error — try again.","back":"back","continue":"Continue","sending":"Sending…","send":"Send","errName":"Please enter your name.","errPain":"Tell us what hurts — that's the one thing we need.","errEmail":"Please enter a valid email.","errEmailReal":"Please use a real work email so we can reply.","errEmailTemp":"Please use a permanent email, not a temporary one.","errConsent":"Please tick the consent box so we can reply."},"hero":{"title":"Your tech partner. Evolved.","sub":"A five-phase method that transforms how your business runs on technology. An AI-first agency — and your end-to-end tech partner.","online":"online","years":"years","projects":"projects","countries":"countries"},"method":{"framework":"The framework","headline":"The 5 method","lead":"Technology accelerates faster every day. Most businesses fall behind. We're the AI specialists who close that gap — a five-phase method that doesn't follow the curve, it bends it. No limits. No legacy. No excuses.","phaseList":"Discover · Diagnose · Design · Deliver","evolve":"Evolve","p1Name":"DISCOVER","p1Tagline":"80% of tech projects fail because no one asked the right question.","p1B1":"we don't start at the solution. we start at the uncomfortable truth","p1B2":"how your business actually runs — not the org-chart version","p1B3":"clarity before code","p2Name":"DIAGNOSE","p2Tagline":"If it can't be measured, it doesn't exist.","p2B1":"every friction, bottleneck, and silent leak — mapped","p2B2":"an executive diagnosis few consultants will sign their name to","p2B3":"quantified truth. zero opinions.","p3Name":"DESIGN","p3Tagline":"We don't prescribe software. We prescribe outcomes.","p3B1":"every architectural decision tied to a business KPI","p3B2":"if it doesn't move the needle, it doesn't make the plan","p3B3":"blueprint, not buzzwords","p4Name":"DELIVER","p4Tagline":"Code without adoption is debt with ego.","p4B1":"victory isn't deploy. it's your team running it without us","p4B2":"understood without a manual. improved without permission.","p4B3":"adoption, not delivery","p5Name":"EVOLVE","p5Tagline":"What doesn't evolve is already dying.","p5B1":"while most invoice and disappear, we stay","p5B2":"your business changes every quarter — your tech has to match","p5B3":"partnership, not project"},"methodPage":{"metaTitle":"Our Method — Discover, Diagnose, Design, Deliver, Evolve | WeEvolveIT","metaDescription":"How WeEvolveIT works: a five-phase method — Discover, Diagnose, Design, Deliver, Evolve. We diagnose what hurts before we prescribe, design the fix around how you operate, ship it with senior engineers in your time zone, and stay so it keeps evolving.","eyebrow":"The Framework","h1":"The 5 Method.","lead":"We run every engagement through five phases — Discover, Diagnose, Design, Deliver, Evolve. It's how a business doctor works: we understand the patient before we treat it, and we stay long after the first prescription.","youGet":"You get","ctaTitle":"Ready to start with the diagnosis?","ctaBody":"Tell us where it hurts. We'll tell you what we'd do about it.","ctaButton":"Start the diagnosis","p1Phase":"Discover","p1Question":"How does your business actually run?","p1Body":"We map your operation as it really works — the workflows, the workarounds, the people. Not the org chart; the reality. No fix is worth anything if it solves the wrong problem.","p1Output":"A shared, honest picture of the current state.","p2Phase":"Diagnose","p2Question":"Where does it hurt, and why?","p2Body":"We isolate the root cause behind the symptom — the bottleneck, the silo, the manual grind, the data nobody trusts. A doctor doesn't prescribe before the diagnosis, and neither do we.","p2Output":"A prioritized diagnosis with the real cost of each issue.","p3Phase":"Design","p3Question":"What's the right fix for you?","p3Body":"We design the solution around your operation — pragmatic, measurable, and built to adopt. No templates forced onto your business; the architecture fits how your team actually works.","p3Output":"A concrete plan, scoped and estimated, with success metrics.","p4Phase":"Deliver","p4Question":"Can you actually ship it?","p4Body":"We build and ship with senior engineers in your time zone — staff augmentation or a full product team. AI is built into how we work, so delivery is faster without cutting corners.","p4Output":"Working software in production, on time and on budget.","p5Phase":"Evolve","p5Question":"What happens after launch?","p5Body":"We stay. Technology that keeps improving as your business changes — monitoring, iteration, and the next opportunity. Because evolving never stops; that's the whole point of the name.","p5Output":"A system that compounds in value instead of decaying."},"diagnosis":{"fallbackName":"friend","caseTitle":"case {id}","casesCount":"{count} cases","viewCase":"view case","learnMore":"learn more","lockedBadge":"locked","scrollHint":"scroll","liveLabel":"live","liveSrLabel":"{count}+ frictions diagnosed across our practice","frictionsDiagnosed":"frictions diagnosed","promptBoxPlaceholder":"describe your own…","promptBoxAria":"Describe your own business pain","promptBoxSubmitAria":"Submit","cancelLabel":"cancel","cancelAria":"Cancel and return to the pain selection","bookCallButton":"book a 30-min call","s2aEyebrow":"[ The audit ]","s2aHeadline":"What's slowing you down?","s2aSubLine1":"You name the friction. We map the fix.","s2aSubLine2":"See what happens next...","s2aPromptExample1":"my site keeps slowing down","s2aPromptExample2":"my ads don't bring in sales","s2aPromptExample3":"I run my whole business on spreadsheets","s2aPromptExample4":"every new tool turns into a headache","s2aPromptExample5":"I don't even know my real numbers","pain_ps1":"my site keeps slowing down","pain_ps2":"my ads don't bring in sales","pain_ps3":"my site crashes every week","pain_ps4":"my team isn't closing deals","pain_ps5":"I don't know who's actually pro