y, Gemini & Google AI Overviews — structured data, llms.txt, AI-crawler access, and more. Get a 0–100 score plus the fixes.","aiEyebrow":"Free tool · GEO / AEO","aiHeroTitle":"Is your business visible to AI search?","aiHeroLead":"Search is moving from blue links to AI answers. Check how citable your site is by ChatGPT, Perplexity, Gemini & Google AI Overviews — a 0–100 score and the exact fixes, instantly.","aiWhatWeCheck":"What we check","aiCheckStructuredData":"Structured data (Schema.org)","aiCheckFaqSchema":"FAQ / Q&A schema","aiCheckLlmsTxt":"llms.txt","aiCheckCrawlerAccess":"AI-crawler access (GPTBot, ClaudeBot, PerplexityBot, Google-Extended)","aiCheckHeadingStructure":"Heading structure","aiCheckTitleMeta":"Title & meta description","aiCheckCanonical":"Canonical URL","aiAuditDisclaimer":"This is a readiness audit (deterministic signals). For a live citation check across AI engines, that's part of our","aiAuditServiceLink":"GEO / AEO service","aiUrlAria":"Website URL","aiSubmitCheck":"Check AI visibility","aiSubmitChecking":"Checking…","gateEyebrow":"Analysis ready","gateTitle":"Unlock your full results","gateBody":"Tell us where to send it and we'll reveal the full report. A senior consultant may follow up with a plan — no spam.","gateNamePh":"Your name","gateNameAria":"Your name","gateEmailPh":"you@company.com","gateEmailAria":"Your email","gatePhonePh":"WhatsApp or phone (optional)","gatePhoneAria":"WhatsApp or phone (optional)","gateCompanyPh":"Company (optional)","gateCompanyAria":"Company (optional)","gatePromptName":"First — what should we call you?","gatePromptCompany":"Where do you work?","gatePromptContact":"Where do we send your results?","gateLabelName":"Name","gateLabelCompany":"Company","gateOptional":"Optional","gateContinue":"Continue","gateBack":"back","gateSubmit":"See results","gateSubmitting":"Loading…","gateNote":"We'll only use your details to send the report and, if you'd like, follow up.","gateNameRequired":"Please enter your name.","g